Hello lovelies, 

Welcome to MAKEUPSPACEWITHNEHA, I earn a certain commission on the tagged products. Thank you so much for supporting this page and if you’re a new subscriber, stay connected and a very warm welcome to you. 

Products used on my face makeup: 
Mars skin tint in shade 8 (half a darker shade for me) 
Morphe concealer in Golden (to highlight) 
Simplynam Beauty Blush Tint in Geet (please note- it has little shimmers in it) 
Kay Beauty Brown Kajal 
Smashbox Mascara 

Mentioned below are my foundation shade matches for your reference:

@narsissist NARS Light Reflecting Foundation- Barcelona (little light but manageable)
@hudabeauty Easy Blur Natural Airbrush Foundation-Dulce De Leche
@esteelauderin Double Wear SIP -Cashew 
@maybelline_ind Matte -Poreless 312 & 228 (both matches me well)
@lovechildbymasaba Lights Camera Foundation -Caramel Romance
@maccosmeticsindia Serum Powered Foundation-NC37 (it’s one shade lighter because NC40 from this range is too orange for me and this one oxidises too, further I tone it down with concealer) 
@kaybykatrina Hydrating Foundation- 145 N Medium (Need to balance it with a warm tone concealer, as 130Y is too light and looks greyish later) 
@charmacymilano CMC Matte Foundation-05
@nykaacosmetics Pore Minimizing Foundation -8Y Medium
@bobbibrownindia Skin Long Wear Weightless Foundation -Honey
@tirtir_global  Red Cushion Mask Fit Foundation -3IN French Beige (I need to color correct it using a warm tone concealer, post oxidisation) 
@maccosmeticsindia Studio Fix Fluid Foundation  -NC40 
